<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank forex reserves $3.48 bln April 2.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank forex reserves $3.48 bln April 2.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Tuesday said its hard currency reserves firmed to $3.483 billion as of April 2 from $3.442 billion on March 25.  </p>
<p> FOREX RESERVES	   April 2  March 25  March 19  Dec 31/96</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)    3.483    3.442     3.444     3.473</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	 1.799    1.870     1.891     2.321</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector  5.282    5.312     5.335     5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
